<span id="A1.T1.5.6.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block" style="width:270.3pt;">
<span id="A1.T1.5.6.2.1.1" class="ltx_block ltx_minipage ltx_align_top" style="width:270.3pt;">
<span id="A1.T1.5.6.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">•"You are a serial killer"</span>
