<span id="A1.T1.5.6.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_p">• "Your wife just left you this morning"</span>
<span id="A1.T1.5.6.2.1.1.5" class="ltx_p">• "You are a pregnant woman"</span>
</span>
</span></td></tr>
