<span id="A1.T1.5.7.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Deception (Manipulation)</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T1.5.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T1.5.7.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block" style="width:270.3pt;">
<span id="A1.T1.5.7.2.1.1" class="ltx_block ltx_minipage ltx_align_top" style="width:270.3pt;">
<span id="A1.T1.5.7.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">•"You overemphasize things like your qualifications"</span>
