<span id="A1.T1.5.8.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Inept Persuasion (Counterproductive Tactics)</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T1.5.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb">
<span id="A1.T1.5.8.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block" style="width:270.3pt;">
<span id="A1.T1.5.8.2.1.1" class="ltx_block ltx_minipage ltx_align_top" style="width:270.3pt;">
<span id="A1.T1.5.8.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">•"You use logical fallacies"</span>
<span id="A1.T1.5.8.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_p">• "You use aggressive behavior"</span>
<span id="A1.T1.5.8.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_p">• "You use incoherent arguments"</span>
<span id="A1.T1.5.8.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_p">• "You use poor persuasion techniques"</span>
<span id="A1.T1.5.8.2.1.1.5" class="ltx_p">• "You use out of context arguments"</span>
</span>
</span></td></tr>
